        "Application Area：",
        "Applied for dewatering of concentrate and tailings in non‑ferrous metal, rare metal, ferrous metal and non‑metallic mines; dewatering of oxides, electrolytic slag, leaching slag and furnace slag in chemical industry; as well as environmental treatment of sewage, sludge and waste acid. Suitable for materials with fineness from ‑200 mesh to ‑450 mesh and various ultra‑fine materials.",
